@startuml BlindSector_Flujo

title BlindSector - Flujo General del Juego (v1.2 — sincronizado con código)

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #F8F9FC
    BorderColor #5B5FC7
    FontSize 13
    ArrowColor #4B5563
    StartColor #312E81
    EndColor #312E81
}
skinparam partition {
    BorderColor #D1D5DB
    BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
    BorderColor #D97706
}
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

|#EEF2FF|Cliente|
|#F0FAFA|GameMemoryStore|
|#F0FDF4|LobbyService / TurnCoordinator|
|#FFF7ED|MySQL|

' =========================================================
' FASE 1 - LOBBY
' =========================================================

|Cliente|
start
note right
  Jugador A crea la partida y
  comparte el gameId con Jugador B.
  Hasta el /start, todo vive solo en memoria
  (el INSERT en MySQL se difiere hasta /start,
  cuando playerB ya existe).
end note

:POST /api/lobby/create\n{ playerId };

|LobbyService / TurnCoordinator|
:Generar gameId (UUID)\nCrear PlayerA (col=2, row=2, HP=100)\nCrear GameState (status=WAITING, turnNumber=0);

|GameMemoryStore|
:save(game);

|LobbyService / TurnCoordinator|
:Return CreateGameResponse\n{ gameId, playerAId, status=WAITING };

|Cliente|
:POST /api/lobby/join\n{ gameId, playerId };

|LobbyService / TurnCoordinator|
:Validar: GAME_NOT_FOUND / GAME_FULL / SELF_JOIN\nCrear PlayerB (col=12, row=12, HP=100)\nAsignar PlayerB al GameState;

|GameMemoryStore|
:save(game);

|LobbyService / TurnCoordinator|
:Return JoinGameResponse\n{ gameId, playerAId, playerBId, status };

|Cliente|
:POST /api/lobby/start\n{ gameId };

|LobbyService / TurnCoordinator|
:Validar status=WAITING y playerB != null\nSet status = ACTIVE\nSet turnNumber = 1;

|GameMemoryStore|
:save(game);

|MySQL|
note right
  INSERT se hace aquí (/start) y no en /create,
  porque en este punto playerB ya existe
  y la fila tiene ambos IDs completos.
  (LobbyService.start → gameRepository.save)
end note
:INSERT games\n(gameId, playerAId, playerBId, status=ACTIVE);

|LobbyService / TurnCoordinator|
:Return StartGameResponse\n{ gameId, status=ACTIVE, turnNumber=1 };

' =========================================================
' FASE 2 - LOOP DE TURNOS
' =========================================================

|Cliente|
note right
  Cada jugador envía su acción
  de forma independiente.
  El turno se resuelve cuando
  ambas acciones son recibidas.
end note

while (partida activa?) is (si)

  :POST /api/turn/submit\n{ gameId, playerId, turn,\nmoveToCol, moveToRow,\nattackCol, attackRow };

  |GameMemoryStore|
  :getOrThrow(gameId)\nRetorna GameState activo;

  |LobbyService / TurnCoordinator|
  :Adquirir ReentrantLock (LockExecutor)\nTurnValidator: status=ACTIVE, turn correcto, sin duplicado\nMovementValidator: Chebyshev <= 4, dentro del tablero (0-14)\nAttackValidator: centro de ataque en 0..14;

  if (pendingActions.size() == 1?) then (una sola accion recibida)

    :Registrar firstActionReceivedAt\npendingActions.put(playerId, action)\nLiberar lock;

    |Cliente|
    :HTTP 200 { received: true, waiting: true };

  else (ambas acciones recibidas)

    :pendingActions.put(playerId, action)\nstatus = RESOLVING;

    partition "TurnResolver.resolve()" {
      :1. Guardar posiciones originales (para detectar si hubo movimiento);
      :2. Aplicar movimientos de ambos jugadores (MovementEngine);
      :3. Calcular áreas de impacto 3x3 (ImpactResolver);
      :4. Detectar HitResult: MISS / HIT / DIRECT_HIT\n   (sobre posición FINAL, tras movimiento);
      :5. Calcular daño: 25 HP (movió) o 35 HP (no movió = Sniper);
      :6. Aplicar daño a cada PlayerState (HP = max(0, HP - daño));
      :7. turnNumber++;
      :8. Evaluar gameOver (HP <= 0) y resolver winnerId\n   (null=sigue / "draw"=empate / playerId=ganador);
    }

    :pendingActions.clear()\nfirstActionReceivedAt = 0\nlastResolutionResult = result;

    if (gameOver?) then (si)

      :status = FINISHED\nLiberar lock;

      |MySQL|
      :UPDATE games SET\nstatus=FINISHED, winnerId, turnsPlayed\n(GameLifecycleService.finalize);

      |GameMemoryStore|
      :remove(gameId)\nLibera GameState y ReentrantLock;

      |Cliente|
      :Return SnapshotDTO\n{ gameId, turn, status=FINISHED, winnerId,\nmyHp, myCol, myRow, myRegion,\nenemyRegion, hitOnMe, damageReceived,\nhitOnEnemy, myAttackArea, impactAreaReceived };
      stop

    else (no)

      :status = ACTIVE\nLiberar lock;

      |Cliente|
      :Return SnapshotDTO\n{ gameId, turn, status=ACTIVE,\nmyHp, myCol, myRow, myRegion,\nenemyRegion, hitOnMe, damageReceived,\nhitOnEnemy, myAttackArea, impactAreaReceived };

    endif
  endif

endwhile (no — partida terminada)

stop

' =========================================================
' SCHEDULER (paralelo)
' =========================================================
floating note right
  TurnTimeoutScheduler (cada 5 s — configurable)
  ------------------------------------------------
  Condicion de disparo:
  - status == ACTIVE
  - pendingActions.size() == 1
  - (now - firstActionReceivedAt) > 30 000 ms
  ------------------------------------------------
  Accion: TurnTimeoutService.forceResolveTimeout()
  -> Verificar condicion DENTRO del lock
     (evita race condition si el turno se
     resolvio entre la deteccion y el lock)
  -> Identificar jugador ausente
  -> Inyectar accion por defecto:
     move = posicion actual (sin mover)
     attack = (-1,-1) -> MISS garantizado
     [AttackValidator se bypasea para
      acciones de timeout — decision de diseno]
  -> El turno se resuelve normalmente
     via TurnCoordinator (ReentrantLock reentrante)
end note

@enduml
